<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end lower at 20.00 percent.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end lower at 20.00 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates eased on Tuesday in ample liquidity and were likely to stay low, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Overnight rates will remain low unless there are some large client orders,&quot; said Robert Szucs of Inter-Europa Bank.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at 20.00 percent on Monday, a shade easier compared with Monday's 20.125 percent closing.</p>
<p>-- Denes Albert, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
